Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now.\NFor together we found.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We look through the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.91,0:01:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there, no regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Camotoy\NGordingus\NLorphex\NPollychan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried\Nonly helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NPamkinPinguin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.15,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(602,267)\bord2\c&HE8E6E7&\3c&H363635&\1a&HFF&\t(561,602,\1a&H00&)\t(2813,2854,\1a&HFF&)}Concerto
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.15,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(602,267)\c&HE8E6E7&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Concerto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the\Nlook on all their faces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when they find out I\Ndiscovered the gold first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those ruins!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground's all crooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold! Gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.31,0:02:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too little to do this all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.35,0:03:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have gone back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.03,0:03:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the third one to\Nmake it this far today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe that spider-headed\Nfool was so careless. You
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killed Geratsu. Didn't you? I guess\Nhe means that guy from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's for the best. The world is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better off with one less\Nimbecile when you agree
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tripped over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.85,0:03:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be so afraid of Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.43,0:03:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's merely a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't bite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's been\Nchewed up and spit out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you, Holy is a\Nvery well-trained dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would never bite anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was I who attacked that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Skybreeder Ohm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now would you please be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm not saddened\Nby what's taking place here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do men choose to fight when they\Nmust know how fragile their lives are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man was put here to find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet time after time they\Nthrow themselves into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only to lose their\Nlives along with the joy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they struggled so hard to\Nfind what a strange and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tragic thing is man's\Nnature. There is only one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way to be redeemed and\Nthat is for all men to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh please sir you don't\Nreally mean that do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you this is bad what\Nhave you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh i was just trying to find the city\Nof gold greed only leads to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only losing your life will save\Nyou from all your earthly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want to rescue me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri! Kamakiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's headed for God's Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Enel isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.01,0:06:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still time, Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody can beat Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am living lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock, hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He comes as lightning, an element that\Nman has feared from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rightly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll stop Wyper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just wait here and save your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave Isis' bag with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody can beat Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.03,0:07:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri is so strong, yet\Nhis will has been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what he said is true, then Enoru's\Neaten a Logia-type Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most powerful kind of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop Wiper\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you laughing at me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you so worked up for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason you came along in\Nthe first place is to get some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bad sense of direction\Nshouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go of that,\Nyou better break, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no more food in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the weird places to end up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I walked all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, maybe it's a trick door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always try busting\Nthrough this stupid thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come, Gum-Gum Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it, it didn't even butch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:08:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't follow me. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's a priest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like there's a lot\Nof places to hide around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just stay hidden\Nlong enough to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can try and meet up with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure he doesn't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looked like a swordsman, so if I\Nkeep my distance, I should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's run quite a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But running from salvation is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attachment to this life is\Na result of evil desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path to peace leads to but one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the ordeal of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The survival rate is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go find Raki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Isa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to save Lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't any of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not any of my business?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way I'm going to sit back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and let a little kid get herself killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, those dirty looks don't\Nscare me, so knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:11:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, stop messing\Naround and get the waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let me go so\NI can save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better knock it off right\Nnow or I'm going to slug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.03,0:11:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you don't want to end up\Nlike Sanji and Usopp, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll help you in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this cave?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, there was an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a flood of ocean clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it going crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deathling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! No! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way leads to the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone into the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missed! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that? I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go that way! That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! Aisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're inside the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey, what's the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to pluck you\Nand cook you up in a stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on! Fly higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be giant snake food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you fly any faster, you dumb bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still coming after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something must have really pissed it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make it to God's Shrine, I have\Nto climb to the top of Giant Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if Enel is there, it's time I\Nbrought an end to our terrible history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, if you climb that vine any\Nfarther, you'll reach God's shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you\Nhave permission to pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adding for that shrine\Nis no longer useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kon-Fo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business do you have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.27,0:16:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still can't let go of your old position?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but I still have\Nresponsibilities I've yet to fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be interested in knowing\NI've recently come from God's shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.53,0:16:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire thing's been utterly destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, Enel was nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it means he no\Nlonger has any need for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that their years\Nof hard labor are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, this island is\Nno longer useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've simply come to bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:17:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand to know ohm what is it\Nyou and your master seek to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you saying energy's not up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of Straw Hats friends
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird's gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys all look pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hand over the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it isn't another greedy infidel\Nseeking his salvation, Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:18:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way or I'll\Ndestroy every one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come, Om.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Eneru and\Nthe Divine Squad are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you each feel what\Nyou have to say is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's only one way for your voice to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be heard, you must\Nsurvive or find salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go holy be as ferocious\Nas you want boy that one
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is our target Pierre since\Nhe is the most powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we must neutralize Eneru's priest first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really getting sick of you, Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:19:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, how the hell'd you\Nget way up here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute this place is\Nup, the other it's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one messed up cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess the three of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will just have to die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to work on your aim there, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent blue sea dweller.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can just come to this\Nland and take what's rightfully ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how long\Nand hard we've struggled
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you sky people want to\Nblow each other to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your business
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I told that\Npriest I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That figures!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have finished you from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's actually\Ntougher than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.19,0:20:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, note to self.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.47,0:20:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta watch out for those poisonous fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:21:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've never seen a dog move like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not many people have, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find that Holy knows a great number\Nof commands beyond just sit and stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a sky breeder, renowned\Nfor my special animal training.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trained him how to\Nwalk upright on two legs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to box just like a\Nchampion prize fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show him, Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice doggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Godfar, you were already beaten by Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know when to quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you really hope to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you even have enough\Nstrength left to wield that spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what Enel is plotting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I will stop him with\Nmy dying breath if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:22:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way a washed-up god like you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could ever understand\NEneru's noble thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, you're a foolish old man, a\Nman that doesn't have long to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the Shandians escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like... goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Divine Squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they catch us, they'll kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.97,0:22:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Divine Squad? Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.45,0:22:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're Aniru's soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.05,0:22:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.53,0:22:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to, but in case you haven't\Nnoticed, I have no idea where we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stupid snake keeps getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was part of your Blue Sea crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.17,0:23:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch his step over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.35,0:23:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.71,0:23:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barbed wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's his ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.23,0:23:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you try and take this guy on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.35,0:23:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shame, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.35,0:23:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those barbs, Iron Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.97,0:23:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their light is a cloud, but hard as iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.65,0:24:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blown into shape by a milky dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.63,0:24:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've rigged several of\Nthem with hidden triggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your little friend found out the\Nhard way what happens when you step on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.39,0:24:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This field is a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.47,0:24:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sit back and watch your\Nown blundering do you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.69,0:24:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm partially responsible for that\Nanimal's defeat, but he's also to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.27,0:24:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stumbled into my ordeal all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you'll want to\Nget revenge now, huh? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.67,0:24:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I normally don't\Nlike fighting for that reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.61,0:24:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.03,0:24:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually impressed. Normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.05,0:24:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Conis, I think we've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.75,0:25:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the seashore where our Blue Sea\Nfriends are planning to meet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.73,0:25:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where Nami told me\Nthey'd be dropping anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.15,0:25:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then what should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.31,0:25:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wasn't expecting\Nto look after their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.59,0:25:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, we must protect it\Nat all costs until they return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sound the horn to scare\Noff any threats. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.69,0:25:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.39,0:25:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them hear our resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.17,0:25:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.41,0:25:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.11,0:25:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you to keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.97,0:25:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.97,0:25:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll nurse both of you back to health.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.93,0:25:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.23,0:26:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, everyone, be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry the Sky Island is like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.17,0:26:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop until we've taken Edaru's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only heads that are\Nall are yours, Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.93,0:26:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climb up to your church!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.35,0:26:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get to God's shrine! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.47,0:26:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, please don't\Nuse the reject anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.29,0:26:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Divine Squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.15,0:26:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.25,0:26:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't challenge Enel, Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.35,0:27:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be defeated,\Nno matter what we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.99,0:27:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.23,0:27:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those of you still in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.45,0:27:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,climb your way to the upper\Nruins and destroy each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.47,0:27:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will only be five survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.35,0:27:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My words and prophecies are absolute!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.85,0:28:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this insanity now, Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.83,0:28:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.74,0:28:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not what, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.73,0:28:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You believe that you're not my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.91,0:28:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the Shandians, there's no\Ndifference between you and Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.85,0:28:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit being stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.19,0:28:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My burn bazooka didn't\Neven faze that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.75,0:28:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those scales made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.77,0:28:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.68,0:28:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.79,0:28:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.69,0:28:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.23,0:29:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.57,0:29:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.99,0:29:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.90,0:29:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.82,0:29:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.73,0:29:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What... was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.41,0:29:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.59,0:29:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Typical Blue Sea Dweller,\Nyou didn't expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.13,0:29:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, this sword of mine\Nis also made of Iron Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.93,0:29:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.11,0:29:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the blade itself is actually\NIron Cloud expelled from
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a dial that's conveniently\Nembedded in the sword's hilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.23,0:29:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it will hunt its prey\Nto the ends of the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.91,0:29:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, do you understand it better\Nnow, swordsman from the Blue Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's just like a whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.15,0:29:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.29,0:29:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You white, white sea people are more\Ncircus performers than warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.13,0:29:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy, we're going to\Nhave to fight separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the sound of things, the Upper\NRuins are about to get very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.15,0:30:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sky Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect him to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.79,0:30:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to assist you, oh mighty Ohm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.53,0:30:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.21,0:30:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.51,0:30:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it means we're the only ones left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.95,0:30:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.11,0:30:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll help you get to Enel\Nand take his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.87,0:30:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just dig my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That giant snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.17,0:31:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.73,0:31:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.81,0:31:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you ghosts just leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.73,0:31:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, Aisa, noob!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill them both!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.95,0:31:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa, what are you doing here? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.25,0:31:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Throw, what's happening? Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.19,0:31:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you're plotting\Nhere, Blue Sea Dweller?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.85,0:31:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa, get away from that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.07,0:31:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.45,0:32:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close. Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.87,0:32:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you two come to\Nsuch a perilous place?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.13,0:32:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were chased by this giant snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.55,0:32:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.46,0:32:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.69,0:32:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Issie...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.59,0:32:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WIPER!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.33,0:32:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so distracted that you\Nneglected to protect yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.63,0:32:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit worrying about other people!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.43,0:32:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.73,0:32:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do to save them.

